# Mossy ruins: a 24x24 walking figure in four directions, two frames each.
# A wanderer with a red tunic, a satchel on a strap and brown hair, lit from the top left.
# Frames 1-2 face south, 3-4 north, 5-6 east; west is a live mirror of east (frames 7-8).
# The feet rest on row 22 (the ground line); the pivot is the pixel between them.
new sprite walker 24x24 palette=mossy-ruins
palette add skin0 hex=#8e5b3e key=s
palette add skin1 hex=#c48a5c key=t
palette add skin2 hex=#e6b98c key=u
palette add cloth0 hex=#4a2420 key=n
palette add cloth1 hex=#7e3a2a key=o
palette add cloth2 hex=#b05a36 key=p
ramp skin = skin0 skin1 skin2
ramp cloth = cloth0 cloth1 cloth2
palette save as=ruins-folk
frame add empty
frame add empty
frame add empty
frame add empty
frame add empty
view S frames=1-2
view N frames=3-4
view E frames=5-6
pivot 11,22
ground 22

